    "detailed_description": "Lipstick Assassin is a Pulp, Sci-Fi, Action, Glam, RPG. An action packed spy world of the future. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Agent Beamera Zanotti (code name: LIPSTICK ASSASSIN), an agent specializing in Extraterrestrial Technologies. The auric fields have become contaminated by toxic poisonous Extraterrestrials . <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour Mission : Collect the Gold Auric Fields and eliminate toxic extraterrestrials. Work way through the portal doors in search of &quot;The Great Stash&quot;. Maneuver, &amp; outsmart enemies. Eliminate enemies with weapons when necessary. All while avoiding deadly explosions. Reach the Executive Level through the portal doors.  Reach and collect  &quot;The Great Stash&quot; of Gold Auric Fields and complete the mission.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperation : Auric Fields",
